      "writtenOn": "2024-05-13T13:37:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think the windows impl can be considered as a good example.\n\nAnd I don\u0027t like `AndroidAudioStream` carrying `buffer_ptr: *const u8`, not a slice. It\u0027s a memory leak, right? I\u0027ve left a comment above as well.\n\nCould you elaborate more on why RefCell couldn\u0027t be used? Did you actually experience an error from the \"runtime\" borrow checker?",
      "parentUuid": "1c8c8925_882d68d7",
      "revId": "f8bd8609fb9c23842a5b69b92bcfc9789f487286",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
